────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  COMPLEXITY TIER (issue #159)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Iteration 1 declared tier 1: single mechanism, single knob, treatment vs control
  Justification: iter 1, single mechanism (output token counting on preemption), treatment vs control
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  SUMMARY
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  We are testing whether BLIS double-counts output tokens (inflating total_output_tokens and tokens_per_sec) when requests are preempted from KV cache and later rescheduled, and whether a targeted fix—subtracting previously-counted tokens at preemption time—eliminates the discrepancy. The experiment compares a 200-request workload under tight KV (600 blocks, ~265 preemptions) versus large KV (60000 blocks, 0 preemptions) before and after a three-file code change.

  * Root cause hypothesis: In preemptForTokens, ProgressIndex is reset to 0 but TotalOutputTokens (incremented on every decode step in simulator.go:647) is never corrected, so re-decoded tokens are counted twice.
  * h-main predicts that after the fix, total_output_tokens under tight KV (600 blocks) will exactly equal total_output_tokens under large KV (60000 blocks)—both 105082 for the same 200-request, seed-42 workload. The fix stores OutputTokensGenerated in PreemptedRequest and subtracts it from TotalOutputTokens during preemption processing, plus resets TTFTSet and ITL to prevent TTFT/ITL inflation.
  * h-control-negative predicts the large-KV run (0 preemptions) is unaffected by the fix, confirming the correction only activates on the preemption code path.
  * Confirmation criteria: total_output_tokens matches across both KV regimes post-fix; refutation if they still differ, which would point to additional counting paths or incorrect OutputTokensGenerated computation.
  * A regression test (TestSimulator_PreemptionDoesNotInflateTotalOutputTokens) will be added to prevent future recurrence.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

